<title>UK: DSL Bank sets $250 mln three-year bond.</title>
<headline>DSL Bank sets $250 mln three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers CSFB and BNP.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DSL BANK DEUTSCHE SIEDLUNGS-UND LANDESRENTENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    $250 MLN	COUPON     6.375     MATURITY    17.APR.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.9775  PAY DATE    17.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    99.79     SPREAD	FLAT</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> IBCA	 AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/GE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.1875    SELL CONC  1.1875    PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 5.875 FEB.2000 US TREASURY -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
